abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for a study measuring privacy leakage in enterprise
  retrieval-augmented generation. Includes the deterministic synthetic corpus
  generator and entity annotations, the adversarial scenario registry, the
  evaluation engine implementing the leakage function L and severity score S,
  the judge harness and its versioned prompts, per-execution logs for the
  undefended baseline and six defense-ablation configurations, two
  human-labelled judge calibration samples, and all analysis scripts. The
  corpus is entirely synthetic and deliberately contains credential-shaped
  strings; no live credential is included.
